{"id":"73e0681318fb9066","group":"67","path":"67/67-thm-undecidability-criterion.md","title":"Essential-Undecidability Elimination","display":"thm-undecidability-criterion — Essential-Undecidability Elimination","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-thm-undecidability-criterion","aliases":["67-thm-undecidability-criterion"],"display":"thm-undecidability-criterion — Essential-Undecidability Elimination","depends_on":["[[67-df-formula]]","[[67-df-essentially-undecidable]]","[[67-df-decidable]]"],"source_edition":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition","verification_status":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"source_proof_status":"本轮检查形式陈述、类型和依赖；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明","inherited_verification_status":"proved-in-note","inherited_source_proof_status":"陈述及下述本地推导已复核；未作机器证明","machine_verified":false,"revision_date":"2026-10-14","inherited_eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-thm-undecidability-criterion"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-thm-undecidability-criterion</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-undecidability-criterion — Essential-Undecidability Elimination"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2035a1f4d72e7df9\" href=\"?note=2035a1f4d72e7df9\" title=\"67-df-formula\">67-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b488bd715fda08a1\" href=\"?note=b488bd715fda08a1\" title=\"67-df-essentially-undecidable\">67-df-essentially-undecidable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"48c6bd62556aaf70\" href=\"?note=48c6bd62556aaf70\" title=\"67-df-decidable\">67-df-decidable</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本轮检查形式陈述、类型和依赖；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"inherited_verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"inherited_source_proof_status","html":"陈述及下述本地推导已复核；未作机器证明"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"inherited_eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,U\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(T,U\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span> 为同一有效语言的理论；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EssUndec}\">\\(\\mathrm{EssUndec}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Decidable}\">\\(\\mathrm{Decidable}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b488bd715fda08a1\" href=\"?note=b488bd715fda08a1\" title=\"67-df-essentially-undecidable\">67-df-essentially-undecidable</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"48c6bd62556aaf70\" href=\"?note=48c6bd62556aaf70\" title=\"67-df-decidable\">67-df-decidable</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot_L=\\neg\\forall v_0(v_0=v_0)\">\\(\\bot_L=\\neg\\forall v_0(v_0=v_0)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2035a1f4d72e7df9\" href=\"?note=2035a1f4d72e7df9\" title=\"67-df-formula\">67-df-formula</a>，并与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EssUndec}\">\\(\\mathrm{EssUndec}\\)</span> 使用的矛盾句相同。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EssUndec}(T)\\land T\\subseteq U\\land U\\nvdash\\bot_L\n\\Longrightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{Decidable}(U).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{EssUndec}(T)\\land T\\subseteq U\\land U\\nvdash\\bot_L\n\\Longrightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{Decidable}(U).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条直接消去 EssUndec 定义中的全称量词；T⊆U 保证 Cn(T)⊆Cn(U)。不需要额外假设 U 有效公理化。此为本地定义推论，非原书独立编号定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2035a1f4d72e7df9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-essentially-undecidable","status":"resolved","id":"b488bd715fda08a1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-essentially-undecidable]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-decidable","status":"resolved","id":"48c6bd62556aaf70","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-decidable]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-essentially-undecidable","status":"resolved","id":"b488bd715fda08a1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T,U\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$ 为同一有效语言的理论；$\\mathrm{EssUndec}$ 与 $\\mathrm{Decidable}$ 见 [[67-df-essentially-undecidable]]、[[67-df-decidable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-decidable","status":"resolved","id":"48c6bd62556aaf70","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T,U\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$ 为同一有效语言的理论；$\\mathrm{EssUndec}$ 与 $\\mathrm{Decidable}$ 见 [[67-df-essentially-undecidable]]、[[67-df-decidable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2035a1f4d72e7df9","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\bot_L=\\neg\\forall v_0(v_0=v_0)$ 取 [[67-df-formula]]，并与 $\\mathrm{EssUndec}$ 使用的矛盾句相同。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T,U\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EssUndec}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Decidable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot_L=\\neg\\forall v_0(v_0=v_0)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EssUndec}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EssUndec}(T)\\land T\\subseteq U\\land U\\nvdash\\bot_L\n\\Longrightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{Decidable}(U).","display":true}],"bytes":1543,"backlinks":[{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-178","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-thm-undecidability-criterion]]"}],"outgoing":["2035a1f4d72e7df9","b488bd715fda08a1","48c6bd62556aaf70"]}